WEBVTT

00:05:28.998 --> 00:05:33.576
(Applause) —

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:38.798
And this is why

00:05:38.822 --> 00:05:44.284
we decided to share the best
mirror in the world with him.

00:05:44.308 --> 00:05:47.218
And we thank you so much, all of you.

00:05:47.242 --> 00:05:49.341
FF: Thank you. RD: Thank you. Bye.

00:05:49.365 --> 00:05:53.178
(Applause)

00:05:53.202 --> 00:05:58.172
FF: Thank you. (Applause)